Package: byteguru-compositor
Source: byteguru
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ByteguruOS Team <devel@byteguru.example>
Installed-Size: 152
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libcairo2 (>= 1.2.4), libwayland-server0 (>= 1.14.91), libwlroots-0.18 (>= 0.18.0), libxkbcommon0 (>= 0.5.0), xkb-data, wl-clipboard, grim, slurp
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Wayland compositor for ByteguruOS (bgwl)
 wlroots-based session compositor: streams (workspaces) with per-stream
 accents, tile/even/floating layouts, real maximise and fullscreen,
 server-side titlebars with buttons, exclusive zones for the panel,
 ext-session-lock and idle handling, laptop lid, screencopy and the rest of
 the protocol set the portals and sandboxed apps need, plus a JSON control
 socket used by the shell and by bgctl.
